<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="SmartERP API documentation for billing, inventory and accounting."
  >

  <title>SmartERP | API Documentation</title>

  {{{redocHead}}}

  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #0f766e;
      --primary-dark: #115e59;
      --navy: #102a43;
      --text: #243447;
      --muted: #62748a;
      --background: #f5f8fc;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --white: #ffffff;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      scroll-padding-top: 24px;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* Top navigation */

    .topbar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 18px 7%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    }

    .brand-icon {
      display: grid;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 17px;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 26px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .nav-links .nav-cta {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    /* Hero section */

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 76px 7% 68px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 90% 10%,
          rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.17),
          transparent 30%
        ),
        linear-gradient(125deg, #102a43 0%, #163f52 60%, #115e59 100%);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 7px 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: #ccfbf1;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #5eead4;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: 25px 0 18px;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 62px);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -2.5px;
      line-height: 1.08;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: #5eead4;
    }

    .hero-description {
      max-width: 660px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #d4e2ed;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 12px 19px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .button-primary {
      background: #5eead4;
      color: #102a43;
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      background: #99f6e4;
    }

    .button-secondary {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .button-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    /* Overview cards */

    .overview {
      padding: 44px 7% 52px;
      background: var(--background);
    }

    .overview-inner {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-kicker {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .overview h2 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 27px;
      letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    }

    .overview-intro {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 12px 0 27px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 23px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.035);
    }

    .card-icon {
      display: grid;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 17px;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: #ccfbf1;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 9px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .code-label {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 5px 8px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* API reference introduction */

    .reference-heading {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 55px 7% 30px;
    }

    .reference-heading h2 {
      margin: 0 0 11px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .reference-heading p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* Footer */

    .footer {
      padding: 27px 7%;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .topbar {
        padding: 15px 5%;
      }

      .nav-links {
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 56px 6% 50px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      }

      .hero-description {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .overview {
        padding: 38px 6%;
      }

      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .reference-heading {
        padding: 43px 6% 25px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html {
        scroll-behavior: auto;
      }

      .button {
        transition: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="SmartERP documentation home">
      <span class="brand-icon">S</span>
      <span>SmartERP</span>
    </a>

    <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
      <a href="#api-reference">API Reference</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#api-reference">Explore API &rarr;</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          Developer Documentation
        </div>

        <h1>
          Build with<br>
          <span>SmartERP API.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-description">
          Explore the API documentation for SmartERP, a billing,
          inventory, and accounting ERP backend. Discover available
          endpoints, understand request formats, and learn how the
          documented operations work.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#api-reference">
            Explore API Reference &rarr;
          </a>

          <a
            class="button button-secondary"
            href="./openapi.json"
            download="smarterp-openapi.json"
          >
            Download OpenAPI JSON
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="overview" id="overview">
      <div class="overview-inner">
        <p class="section-kicker">Get started</p>

        <h2>Your guide to the SmartERP API</h2>

        <p class="overview-intro">
          Use this documentation to explore the endpoints currently
          described in the API specification. Each operation includes
          its available parameters, request details, and documented
          responses.
        </p>

        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/&gt;</div>

            <h3>Explore endpoints</h3>

            <p>
              Browse the available API operations by resource.
              Expand an operation to inspect its parameters,
              request body, and response definitions.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128274;</div>

            <h3>Understand access</h3>

            <p>
              Review each operation's documented authentication
              and access requirements before making a request.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">{ }</div>

            <h3>Use the specification</h3>

            <p>
              Download the OpenAPI JSON description to inspect
              the API contract or use it with compatible
              development tools.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="api-reference">
      <div class="reference-heading">
        <p class="section-kicker">Technical reference</p>
        <h2>API Reference</h2>

        <p>
          Browse the documented operations below. Open an endpoint
          to review its HTTP method, parameters, request schema,
          and available responses.
        </p>
      </div>

      {{{redocHTML}}}
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <strong>SmartERP API</strong><br>
    Billing &middot; Inventory &middot; Accounting<br>
    API documentation generated from the OpenAPI specification.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>